<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Keoyang TBN - (built 140,000 tonnes Neptune Terminal plus Roberts Bank/South Korea 21/12-7/1 $6.09 fio seven days shinc Posco.</p>
<p>ORE - Alina - 110,000 tonnes ore Gladstone/Taranto mid Dec $11.50 fio 35,000 shinc/35,000 shinc Sidermar.</p>
<p>TBN 120,000 tonnes Tubarao/Dunkirk East 10-25/12 $7.80 fio six days shinc Klaveness.</p>
<p>TBN 150,000 tonnes Port Hedland/Constanza Dec approx. $8.80 fio 80,000 shinc/23,000 fx BHP.</p>
</text>
